stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> downloading: queue (add_torrent or queue_delivery)
    downloading --> downloading: not finished yet
    downloading --> subtitled: download done, subtitles processed
    subtitled --> delivered: copied, checksums match, Jellyfin checked
    downloading --> failed: 3 failed attempts
    subtitled --> failed: 3 failed attempts
    failed --> downloading: deliver or queue_delivery retries
    delivered --> [*]: user approves removal, job file dropped
    note right of subtitled
        A retry after a crash resumes here:
        subtitles are not repeated
    end note
